## Schema

### Optional

- `api_token` (String, Sensitive) An Omni API token. Falls back to `OMNI_API_TOKEN`, then `OMNI_API_KEY`.
- `base_url` (String) Your Omni instance URL, for example `https://blobsrus.omniapp.co`. Falls back to `OMNI_BASE_URL`.
- `timeout_seconds` (Number) Per-request timeout in seconds. Defaults to `60`, or `OMNI_TIMEOUT_SECONDS`.
